[h1]琉焰卿的永恒轮回 / Glassfire Lord's Eternal Recurrence[/h1]
[h2]……我将永不停歇地，一次次回到那个你还在的冬日[/h2]
[h2]...I shall never cease to return, again and again, to that winter day where you still dwell.[/h2]

轮回 roguelike：每一世的功业都会结算为分数，纪录跨存档全局保存；新开局时，琉焰卿会把纪录的副本交给你——在「轮回当铺」里消费它，开始更强的一生。

A reincarnation roguelike: every life is scored at death, and your record persists globally across saves. At each new start, the Glassfire Lord hands you a copy of that record to spend in the Pawnshop of Recurrence.

[h1]玩法 / Gameplay[/h1]

开局「终末之契」：接受契约获得特质【琉焰之视】，拒绝则本局纯净无 mod。
Accept the pact (gain the Glassfire Gaze trait) or decline for a vanilla run.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/15858933431013250817/35F8ED403593CFC12C6D3F9EA599BA6B98F47472/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

「轮回当铺」：分数 = 全局最高纪录的副本。购买六维属性、金钱/威望/虔诚/影响力/宗族威望、预期寿命、免费宗教改革（每局限一次）；每件商品越买越贵（×1.2），剩余分数开局时转为金币。
Spend a copy of your record on attributes, resources, lifespan, a once-per-run free faith reformation; prices inflate ×1.2 per purchase, leftovers convert to gold.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12568680649862568476/860585B2C756BBAA51AADE7EB1DC4B2A20CC19E5/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

死亡结算完整明细，破纪录写入全局（教程通知）；确认后进入观察者模式，不可继续扮演后代。
Full score breakdown on death; new records are written globally; the run then ends in observer mode.
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/13660478083691512905/9BED1CE13F8414ABCDC72C3742CA6349E309A9A2/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12306923708257855021/CFD03A6CF4DC5104DF8E1455C5C83D243382BC20/?imw=5000&imh=5000&ima=fit&impolicy=Letterbox&imcolor=%23000000&letterbox=false[/img]

[h1]本地化 / Localization[/h1]
简中 / English / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

[i]注意：需开启教程（reactive advice）；单机定位。/ Requires tutorial (reactive advice) enabled; single-player oriented.[/i]

